---
import Eyebrow from "../../ui/Eyebrow.astro";
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center bg-blue-700 px-5 py-20 text-center text-white">
  <Eyebrow
    icon="heroicons:sparkles"
    text="WEBSITE DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT"
    class="badge-outline absolute left-1/2 top-20 mb-6 -translate-x-1/2"
  />

  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-2xl flex-col">
    <h2 class="section-heading text-white">
      Does your website make<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      your business look as<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      good as it really is?
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto text-xl text-white/80">
      An outdated, generic or disconnected digital presence can undermine
      the credibility you've spent years building. The right design reflects
      your expertise and gives your brand the presence it deserves.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute left-1/2 bottom-20">
    <a
      href="#services"
      aria-label="Scroll to services"
      class=" left-1/2 flex h-9 w-6 -translate-x-1/2 items-start justify-center rounded-full border border-white/90 pt-[3px]"
    >
      <span id="ball" class="mt-auto mb-[2px] size-1.5 rounded-full bg-white"></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #ball {
    animation: ball-down 1.4s ease-in infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ball-down {
    from {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    to {
      transform: translateY(1.25rem);
    }
  }
</style>
